Hold the robot until the control stack drives the motors, and hold scene spawn postures.

Generated against unitree_mujoco ae6a8403e272733e9996ef59990880330496177f, with 001-006 applied.
Until a lowcmd drives a motor its command is zero, so the robot would fall before a balance
policy exists. Each motor holds its initial angle until its first non-zero command, and the
scene's pelvis_startup_hold weld releases 0.5 s after every motor is driven. Equalities are
switched only from mjcb_control, on the physics thread.

